{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484012,"name":"Nimish Goel","username":"Nimish_Goel","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/8edcca/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-05T11:15:12.257Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484012-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484012-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484012-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484012-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSince today, Grok Bot fails on both my Windows laptop (WiFi) and my phone (mobile data): “Can’t Reach Grok Bot’s Computer / A firewall, VPN, or proxy such as Zscaler may be blocking the connection / *.cursorvm.com”. Two different networks, same error - not a local network issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter signing out and back in, the app is stuck on “Reconnecting to your computer…” and shows “No saved Bots yet” - my existing bots are all missing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484012-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484012-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen Grok Bot on my Windows laptop (WiFi) or my phone (mobile data) - both fail with “Can’t Reach Grok Bot’s Computer”. After signing out and back in, the app is stuck on “Reconnecting to your computer…” and shows “No saved Bots yet” - my existing bots are all missing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484012-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484012-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484012-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484012-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot (Windows app, plus the app on my phone). Can’t copy the version from Grok Bot → About Grok Bot because the app is stuck on “Reconnecting to your computer…” and won’t load.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484012-additional-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484012-additional-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m a paying user and currently can’t use the product at all. Looks like the same reattach issue as other threads here. Please fix backend-side or tell me how to restore my bots.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccount email: nimish@true-fan.in\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484012-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484012-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-05T11:15:29.534Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":35,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":176.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170694,"topic_slug":"paid-user-cant-reach-grok-bots-computer-on-all-devices-bots-missing-after-re-login","display_username":"Nimish Goel","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136305,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_v